# MP4 & YouTube Viewer

A lightweight browser app that lets you play:

- YouTube links
- Direct MP4 URLs
- Local MP4 files from your device

## Run it locally

From the project folder, start a simple static web server:

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then open:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

## Features

- Paste a YouTube watch/share URL and it will embed the video inline
- Paste a direct MP4 URL and it will play in the browser
- Upload a local MP4 file for offline playback
- Playback controls included via the HTML5 video player

## Files

- `index.html` – app structure
- `style.css` – styling
- `script.js` – logic for YouTube vs MP4 handling

## Notes

Some remote MP4 sources may block browser playback depending on CORS or server restrictions. YouTube embeds are supported as long as the link is valid.


